child the step-by-step guide to enjoying yoga with children of all ages","covers":[12761452],"works":[{"key":"/works/OL27060303W"}],"key":"/books/OL38213157M","local_id":["urn:bwbsku:P2-ETS-427"],"latest_revision":2,"revision":2,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2022-05-28T08:07:49.398265"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2023-01-14T12:26:34.876566"}}},"ISBN:9780141978246":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9780141978246","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL38803739M/Roots_of_Yoga","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL38803739M/Roots_of_Yoga","details":{"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL628690A","name":"James Mallinson"},{"key":"/authors/OL3864596A","name":"Mark Singleton"}],"isbn_13":["9780141978246"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"publish_date":"2017","publishers":["Penguin Books, Limited"],"source_records":["bwb:9780141978246"],"title":"Roots of Yoga","full_title":"Roots of Yoga","works":[{"key":"/works/OL20675281W"}],"key":"/books/OL38803739M","latest_revision":1,"revision":1,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2022-07-18T17:37:44.588112"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2022-07-18T17:37:44.588112"}}},"ISBN:9780241253045":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9780241253045","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL27956926M/Roots_of_Yoga","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL27956926M/Roots_of_Yoga","thumbnail_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/9345253-S.jpg","details":{"publishers":["Penguin Classics","PENGUIN"],"physical_format":"paperback","lc_classifications":["B132.Y6","B132.Y6 R66 2017"],"source_records":["amazon:0241253047","bwb:9780241253045","promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2022-03-17","marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_008.bib.mrc:84811363:3970"],"title":"Roots of Yoga","notes":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Source title: Roots of Yoga (Penguin Classics)"},"number_of_pages":592,"covers":[9345253],"isbn_13":["9780241253045"],"isbn_10":["0241253047"],"publish_date":"Apr 11, 2017","key":"/books/OL27956926M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL2847600A","name":"Sir James Mallinson"},{"key":"/authors/OL3864596A","name":"Mark Singleton"},{"key":"/authors/OL2847600A","name":"Sir James Mallinson"},{"key":"/authors/OL3864596A","name":"Mark Singleton"}],"works":[{"key":"/works/OL20675281W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"local_id":["urn:bwbsku:O4-AGB-330"],"oclc_numbers":["928480104"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"description":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Yoga is hugely popular around the world today, yet until now little has been known of its roots. This book collects, for the first time, core teachings of yoga in their original form, translated and edited by two of the world's foremost scholars of the subject. It includes a wide range of texts from different schools of yoga, languages and eras: among others, key passages from the early Upanisads and the Mahabharata , and from the Tantric, Buddhist and Jaina traditions, with many pieces in scholarly translation for the first time. Covering yoga's varying definitions across systems, models of the esoteric and physical bodies, and its most important practices, such as posture, breath control, sensory withdrawal and meditation, Roots of Yoga is a unique and essential source of knowledge."},"latest_revision":5,"revision":5,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2020-04-25T09:04:21.972238"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2025-06-10T18:44:19.904184"}}},"ISBN:9780195395358":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9780195395358","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL23203039M/Yoga_body","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL23203039M/Yoga_body","thumbnail_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/14603146-S.jpg","details":{"publishers":["Oxford University Press"],"table_of_contents":[{"level":0,"title":"Introduction","type":{"key":"/type/toc_item"}},{"level":0,"title":"An outline of the project","type":{"key":"/type